[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 481.55, "timestamp": "00:08:01", "text": "因为我上传了，所以显示为灰色。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 485.11, "timestamp": "00:08:05", "text": "星期一还是星期天，因为我太笨了，因为我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 487.749, "timestamp": "00:08:07", "text": "花时间去做事。所以我是个笨蛋"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 493.07, "timestamp": "00:08:13", "text": "笨蛋。是的，这周我们有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 495.83, "timestamp": "00:08:15", "text": "星期一我们拥有了永恒，现在就是这样了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 498.71, "timestamp": "00:08:18", "text": "今天直播的是永恒轮回。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 501.43, "timestamp": "00:08:21", "text": "晚上10:30我从 I 开始直播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 504.23, "timestamp": "00:08:24", "text": "直播开始20分钟或10分钟"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 505.869, "timestamp": "00:08:25", "text": "迟到了几分钟"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 509.749, "timestamp": "00:08:29", "text": "因为 OBS 崩溃了。我确实说过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 513.67, "timestamp": "00:08:33", "text": "故事就是这样，我重新安装了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 517.469, "timestamp": "00:08:37", "text": "发布候选版本二"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 521.029, "timestamp": "00:08:41", "text": "嗯，测试版本二确实如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 524.949, "timestamp": "00:08:44", "text": "修一些东西，但正如你所看到的，呃，就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 527.75, "timestamp": "00:08:47", "text": "你可以看到我的可视化工具还没有修复。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 531.35, "timestamp": "00:08:51", "text": "感觉就像我说话的时候只关注视觉效果一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 534.63, "timestamp": "00:08:54", "text": "可视化图层类似于场景"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 536.949, "timestamp": "00:08:56", "text": "色彩饱和度很高，但图像却不饱和。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 538.03, "timestamp": "00:08:58", "text": "饱和"}]